InventoryCollectService and ConfigurationCollectService each refuse with `VENDOR_UNSUPPORTED` in the same position, around lines 69 and 60 respectively.

The device row carries the role as `DeviceRecord.role()`, a String whose only two values are `gateway` and `management_server`, enforced by a CHECK constraint in migration V21. Every row existing before that migration was backfilled to `gateway`.

The controllers already map an AdmissionRefused to HTTP 409 with a body of `error`, `code` and `reason`; nothing about that mapping changes.
